  "bodyHash": "58b4cdd3e574e16d",
  "content": "<p>本模组为每个类别添加了约 280 种方块。（未来将增加更多类别）</p>\n<p><strong>重要提示 - </strong><strong>模组依赖关系！！！</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Forge：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>自 <strong>Minecraft 1.19.4</strong> 起，需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NeoForge：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>始终需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Fabric：</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>对于 <strong>Minecraft 1.19.4 至 1.21.4</strong>，需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library – Fabric</strong>。</li>\n<li>从 <strong>Minecraft 1.21.5</strong> 开始，需要 <strong>Blackwolf Library</strong>（不再需要 <em>Blackwolf Library – Fabric</em>）。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blackwolf-library\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DjX58no.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></strong></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blackwolf-library-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mxUSBjd.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p>可用的类别（目前）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">按钮</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">地毯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">箱子（Forge 和 NeoForge 自 Minecraft 1.21.10 起可用）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">门</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">栅栏和栅栏门</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">梯子（Forge 自 Minecraft 1.21.5 起可用，Fabric 和 NeoForge 自 Minecraft 1.21.8 起可用）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">压力板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">告示牌（及其对应的墙上的告示牌）（Forge 和 NeoForge 自 Minecraft 1.21.10 起可用）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">台阶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">垂直台阶（Forge 自 Minecraft 1.21.4 起可用，NeoForge 自 Minecraft 1.21.8 起可用）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">楼梯</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">活板门</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\">墙</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>本模组从原版 Minecraft 方块中提取纹理。因此，它们可以像往常一样被资源包覆盖。</p>\n<p>与所有资源包兼容。</p>\n<p>它兼容：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a></p>\n<p>要创建这些新方块，您必须先创建特定类别的<strong>框架</strong>。<strong>以下是配方的示例。</strong></p>\n<p>您可以使用原版游戏中相应类别的任何方块来制作配方。（例如：对于门框架，可以使用木门；对于活板门框架，可以使用铁活板门）</p>\n<p>现在，您可以将<strong>框架</strong>与您想要其纹理的方块结合使用。<strong>以下是一些示例。</strong></p>\n<p>一些方块会像其对应的原版方块一样发光。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>欢迎在您的整合包中使用本模组</strong></em></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>方块展示</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分按钮</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hd8w2JK.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"386\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<strong>部分地毯</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mOknSip.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"231\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有门</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u2W1e4L.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"256\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有栅栏</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v2qYh8v.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"241\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有栅栏门</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SK7qAPi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"224\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有压力板</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NAeli01.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"268\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分台阶</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EhVZwf1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"169\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分楼梯</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6tLWFRL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"238\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有活板门</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iTtbTPW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"279\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>所有墙</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fNRRoFI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"238\"></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>框架配方示例</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>按钮框架</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2yOVYA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"510\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>地毯框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VcQpm9m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"517\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>门框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sz0UO2w.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>栅栏框架和栅栏门框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OGKxalp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"560\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f67kLQp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"556\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>压力板框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7seZElJ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"525\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<strong>台阶框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nG62lua.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"666\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>楼梯框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2NHJERI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"523\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>活板门框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8VWtx4y.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"660\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>墙框架</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RS6U7Bp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"667\"></p>\n</div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>部分方块合成示例</strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>沙子按钮、钻石块地毯、黑曜石冰霜门、岩浆块栅栏和浅蓝色染色玻璃栅栏门</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lZm3B3J.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"197\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zo9mxQv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"207\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QbRI4mX.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lMWgvfV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"193\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1FJ0Nq4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"197\"></p>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>岩浆块压力板、镶金黑石台阶、镶金黑石楼梯、黑曜石冰霜活板门和岩浆块墙</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hMO1FUZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"194\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K6Joh7Q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fQXEBdD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"192\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xWrEAVq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ohE0ve5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"204\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>奇异门（无纹理）</strong></p>\n<p>这是一种特殊的门，您需要特定的合成方法，可以使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Items (JEI)</a> 查看。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblackwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/112d23b8-9986-4823-80de-d312484cf8c8.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"170\"></a></p>\n<p>BisectHosting 提供快速、简单且高质量的服务器托管服务，在全球拥有十多个地点，确保低延迟。购买后，服务器已配置完毕，即可直接使用。凭借他们的全天候支持和快速响应时间，任何问题都不会成为阻碍！</p>\n<p>使用促销代码 <strong>BLACKWOLF</strong>，在购买任何游戏服务器时享受首月 25% 的折扣。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fblackwolf\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/blackwolf</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><em><strong>欢迎在您的整合包中使用本模组</strong></em></span></p>",
